  "description": "Server-side .NET Reactor SDK for generating license files programmatically. Supports .NET Framework 4.0 and .NET Standard 2.0, including hardware-locked licenses and external RSA signing through a KMS or HSM. Keep the package, project files, and master keys on trusted backend systems; do not deploy them to end-user devices.",
